<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:32:27 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“注意力”是智力的本质吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/is-attention-the-essence-of-intelligence</link><description>数学机制使人工智能模型能够大规模处理语言，为当前的人工智能革命奠定了基础。我们的专栏作家问：为什么注意力是关键？&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/is-attention-the-essence-of-intelligence.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:32:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/is-attention-the-essence-of-intelligence</guid></item><item><title>太空垃圾危机有一个解决方案！我们现在需要使用它！康斯珀专访！</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/theres-a-solution-to-the-space-junk-crisis-we-need-to-use-it-now-comspoc-interview</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:17:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/theres-a-solution-to-the-space-junk-crisis-we-need-to-use-it-now-comspoc-interview</guid></item><item><title>新研究发现记忆不仅仅存在于大脑中</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/memories-are-not-only-in-the-brain-new-research-finds</link><description>事实证明，你的大脑可能不是身体唯一有记忆的部分。纽约大学的科学家发现，大脑外部的细胞（例如肾脏中的细胞）实际上可以“学习”并形成记忆。通过模仿大脑如何使用间隔重复来处理信息（例如在间歇性学习中），研究人员表明，即使是非脑细胞也可以激活关键的记忆基因来响应模式。这表明记忆不仅仅是大脑的东西，它可能是体内许多细胞的基本特征。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/memories-are-not-only-in-the-brain-new-research-finds.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:02:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/memories-are-not-only-in-the-brain-new-research-finds</guid></item><item><title>固特异设计了一种可以帮助汽车飞行的轮胎</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/goodyear-designed-a-tire-that-could-help-cars-fly</link><description>固特异推出了一款新概念轮胎，既可以用作飞行汽车的螺旋桨，也可以用作普通轮胎。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/goodyear-designed-a-tire-that-could-help-cars-fly.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:47:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/goodyear-designed-a-tire-that-could-help-cars-fly</guid></item><item><title>通过发现毕达哥拉斯定理创造历史的青少年发表了第一篇带有新证明的学术论文</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/teens-who-made-history-with-pythagoras-theorem-discovery-publish-their-first-academic-paper-with-new-proofs</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:32:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/teens-who-made-history-with-pythagoras-theorem-discovery-publish-their-first-academic-paper-with-new-proofs</guid></item><item><title>布莱恩·博伊德谈故事的起源</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/brian-boyd-on-the-origin-of-stories</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brian-boyd-on-the-origin-of-stories.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:17:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/brian-boyd-on-the-origin-of-stories</guid></item><item><title>马斯克警告称，随着欧盟审查的继续，延迟批准“将导致生命损失”，特斯拉在欧洲更名为 FSD</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/tesla-renames-fsd-in-europe-after-musk-warned-delayed-approval-will-cost-lives-as-eu-scrutiny-continues</link><description>由于最初的名称是否夸大了该系统的功能，监管机构面临压力，特斯拉已将其全自动驾驶软件在欧洲更名为“特斯拉辅助驾驶”。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tesla-renames-fsd-in-europe-after-musk-warned-delayed-approval-will-cost-lives-as-eu-scrutiny-continues2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:02:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/tesla-renames-fsd-in-europe-after-musk-warned-delayed-approval-will-cost-lives-as-eu-scrutiny-continues</guid></item><item><title>再生医学可以从液化天然气工厂学到什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/what-regenerative-medicine-could-learn-from-lng-plants</link><description>对液化天然气工厂进行模拟可以帮助大规模培养人类干细胞。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/what-regenerative-medicine-could-learn-from-lng-plants.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:47:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/what-regenerative-medicine-could-learn-from-lng-plants</guid></item><item><title>高通首席执行官暗示，能够运行 100B LLM 的智能手机可能会在 2028 年问世，而无需解决房间里的两只大象； DRAM 供应与成本</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/qualcomm-ceo-hints-that-smartphones-capable-of-running-100b-llms-could-arrive-by-2028-without-addressing-two-elephants-in-the-room-dram-supply-cost</link><description>在智能手机上运行时，精炼的 20B 至 30B 模型可以接近 100B 的质量。对于公司来说，这似乎是更适合市场的策略，因为它是最现实的。可悲的是，高通首席执行官在没有概述路线图的情况下发表这样的声明并不会让我们更接近在智能手机上运行更密集的模型，但想象这些设备具有与更大的机器相同的功能仍然是一个不错的想法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/qualcomm-ceo-hints-that-smartphones-capable-of-running-100b-llms-could-arrive-by-2028-without-addressing-two-elephants-in-the-room-dram-supply-cost2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:32:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/qualcomm-ceo-hints-that-smartphones-capable-of-running-100b-llms-could-arrive-by-2028-without-addressing-two-elephants-in-the-room-dram-supply-cost</guid></item><item><title>分子开关使脂肪燃烧与生物钟、饮食和周围温度同步</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/a-molecular-switch-syncs-fat-burning-to-the-body-clock-our-diet-and-the-temperature-around-us</link><description>棕色脂肪燃烧燃料产生热量，这种活动由生物钟控制：它在睡眠期间下降，在醒来前上升。但寒冷的早晨或没吃一顿饭对时钟提出了从未计划过的要求。身体如何在即兴发挥的同时保持固定的能量时间表长期以来一直是一个谜。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-molecular-switch-syncs-fat-burning-to-the-body-clock-our-diet-and-the-temperature-around-us.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:17:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/a-molecular-switch-syncs-fat-burning-to-the-body-clock-our-diet-and-the-temperature-around-us</guid></item></channel></rss>